lpha_sanctuary\",title:\"Alpha Wave Sanctuary\",purpose:\"Room Tranquility & Stress Relief\",science:\"432 Hz Solfeggio \u2022 10 Hz Alpha\",description:\"Warm acoustic pads with gentle alpha oscillations designed to quiet the nervous system and ease racing thoughts.\",icon:\"fa-infinity\",artwork:\"./thumb_alpha_sanctuary.jpg\",baseFreq:432,binauralDiff:10,chordNotes:[216,288,324,432,540],defaultStems:{pads:.8,brownian:.35,rain:.1,binaural:.45,piano:.6}},{id:\"deep_delta\",title:\"Deep Delta Sleep\",purpose:\"Deep Sleep & Night Wind-Down\",science:\"2.5 Hz Delta \u2022 Somatic Rest\",description:\"Sub-bass resonance paired with 2.5 Hz delta waves to trigger somatic parasympathetic relaxation and natural sleep onset.\",icon:\"fa-moon\",artwork:\"./thumb_night_sleep.jpg\",baseFreq:174,binauralDiff:2.5,chordNotes:[87,130.5,174,261],defaultStems:{pads:.9,brownian:.5,rain:.05,binaural:.65,piano:.3}},{id:\"brownian_rain\",title:\"Brownian Rain Shield\",purpose:\"ADHD & Noise Masking Shield\",science:\"1/f\xb2 Brownian Noise \u2022 Rain\",description:\"Deep brownian noise fused with steady raindrops to form an acoustic privacy shield against sudden room noises and ADHD distraction.\",icon:\"fa-cloud-rain\",artwork:\"./thumb_rain_nature.jpg\",baseFreq:256,binauralDiff:8,chordNotes:[128,192,256,384],defaultStems:{pads:.4,brownian:.85,rain:.65,binaural:.3,piano:.4}},{id:\"zen_garden\",title:\"Zen Garden Harmonics\",purpose:\"0.1 Hz Breathing & HRV Reset\",science:\"528 Hz Transformation \u2022 0.1 Hz LFO\",description:\"Solfeggio 528 Hz harmonic chords with slow 0.1 Hz LFO breathing cycles that match optimal Heart Rate Variability (HRV).\",icon:\"fa-spa\",artwork:\"./thumb_alpine_starlight.jpg\",baseFreq:528,binauralDiff:7.83,chordNotes:[264,396,528,660],defaultStems:{pads:.75,brownian:.3,rain:.15,binaural:.4,piano:.7}},{id:\"forest_dusk\",title:\"Forest Dusk & Hearth\",purpose:\"Anxiety Relief & Cozy Calm\",science:\"Biophilic 396 Hz \u2022 Hearth\",description:\"Night forest crickets, crackling fireplace embers, and evening breezes proven to lower stress hormones.\",icon:\"fa-tree\",artwork:\"./thumb_deep_flow.jpg\",baseFreq:396,binauralDiff:6,chordNotes:[198,297,396,495],defaultStems:{pads:.5,brownian:.4,rain:.25,binaural:.35,piano:.5}},{id:\"cosmic_float\",title:\"Cosmic Float & Stillness\",purpose:\"Overthinking Reset & Mental Rest\",science:\"288 Hz Non-Predictive Drones\",description:\"Zero-gravity ambient drone pads that flow without repetitive hooks, allowing the brain to stop predicting and rest.\",icon:\"fa-meteor\",artwork:\"./thumb_alpine_starlight.jpg\",baseFreq:288,binauralDiff:9,chordNotes:[144,216,288,432,576],defaultStems:{pads:.85,brownian:.3,rain:.05,binaural:.5,piano:.65}},{id:\"flow_state\",title:\"Deep Flow & Study\",purpose:\"Deep Work, Focus & Study Blocks\",science:\"6 Hz Theta Focus \u2022 320 Hz\",description:\"Isochronic theta waves and smooth analog warmth to anchor focus, stop mind-wandering, and promote deep flow.\",icon:\"fa-fire-flame-curved\",artwork:\"./thumb_deep_flow.jpg\",baseFreq:320,binauralDiff:6,chordNotes:[160,240,320,480],defaultStems:{pads:.6,brownian:.6,rain:.2,binaural:.5,piano:.5}}],Nl=[{id:\"midnight\",name:\"Midnight Obsidian\",icon:\"\ud83c\udf19\",bg:\"#05070d\",cardBg:\"rgba(13, 19, 33, 0.92)\",accent:\"#38bdf8\",accentGlow:\"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4)\",border:\"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2)\"},{id:\"sunrise\",name:\"Sunrise Amber\",icon:\"\u2600\ufe0f\",bg:\"#0d0805\",cardBg:\"rgba(33, 20, 13, 0.92)\",accent:\"#f59e0b\",accentGlow:\"rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4)\",border:\"rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25)\"},{id:\"forest\",name:\"Forest Biophilic\",icon:\"\ud83c\udf43\",bg:\"#050d08\",cardBg:\"rgba(13, 33, 20, 0.92)\",accent:\"#10b981\",accentGlow:\"rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4)\",border:\"rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25)\"},{id:\"lavender\",name:\"Lavender Dusk\",icon:\"\u2728\",bg:\"#0a0612\",cardBg:\"rgba(26, 15, 42, 0.92)\",accent:\"#a855f7\",accentGlow:\"rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4)\",border:\"rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25)\"}],Ya=[{text:\"Calm is a superpower. In a world of constant overreaction, stillness is your edge.\",author:\"Naval Ravikant\"},{text:\"A calm nervous system is the biological prerequisite for high-level creative problem solving.\",author:\"Neuroscience Principle\"},{text:\"When you slow your breathing to 6 breaths a minute, your brain signals the heart that you are completely safe.\",author:\"Heart Rate Variability Research\"},{text:\"Deep acoustic frequencies downregulate cortisol and activate somatic parasympathetic recovery.\",author:\"Acoustic Biology\"},{text:\"Alpha brainwaves (8\u201312 Hz) bridge conscious focus with effortless calm and heightened intuition.\",author:\"Cognitive Neuroscience\"},{text:\"Brownian noise filters ambient interruptions, protecting the fragile flow state of the prefrontal cortex.\",author:\"Auditory Masking Science\"},{text:\"Binaural delta waves stimulate the release of restorative somatic hormones and deep physical healing.\",author:\"Sleep Science\"},{text:\"The vagus nerve is the biological brake on stress; long exhalations activate it within seconds.\",author:\"Physiology Research\"},{text:\"Silence is not the absence of sound, but the presence of neural coherence and mental space.\",author:\"Neuro-Acoustics\"},{text:\"Rest is not idleness, but the essential neurobiological phase where memories consolidate and insights emerge.\",author:\"Cognitive Science\"},{text:\"Theta waves (4\u20137 Hz) occur during deep meditation and REM sleep, enabling spontaneous creative synthesis.\",author:\"Brainwave Research\"},{text:\"A quiet room is the ultimate luxury in a world engineered for digital hyper-stimulation.\",author:\"Stillness Philosophy\"},{text:\"The brain cannot enter deep creative focus while locked in sympathetic fight-or-flight reactivity.\",author:\"Neuro-Cognitive Study\"},{text:\"Isochronic pulses synchronize both cerebral hemispheres, fostering unified mental clarity.\",author:\"Acoustic Neurometry\"},{text:\"True mental recovery occurs when visual and auditory input is reduced to soothing, coherent rhythms.\",author:\"Sensory Biology\"},{text:\"You have power over your mind, not outside events. Realize this, and you will find immense strength.\",author:\"Marcus Aurelius\"},{text:\"Tranquility is nothing else than the good ordering of the mind.\",author:\"Marcus Aurelius\"},{text:\"Nowhere can man find a quieter or more untroubled retreat than in his own soul.\",author:\"Marcus Aurelius\"},{text:\"Give your mind the same quiet dignity you give your body when you rest.\",author:\"Seneca\"},{text:\"We suffer more often in imagination than in reality.\",author:\"Seneca\"},{text:\"It is not the man who has too little, but the man who craves more, that is poor.\",author:\"Seneca\"},{text:\"He who is calm and tranquil will hardly feel the pressure of age.\",author:\"Plato\"},{text:\"Freedom is the only worthy goal in life. It is won by disregarding things that lie beyond our control.\",author:\"Epictetus\"},{text:\"Silence is better than unmeaning words.\",author:\"Pythagoras\"},{text:\"Do not let future events disturb you. You will face them with the same weapon of reason.\",author:\"Marcus Aurelius\"},{text:\"He who fears death will never do anything worthy of a living man.\",author:\"Seneca\"},{text:\"A man is as wretched as he has convinced himself he is.\",author:\"Seneca\"},{text:\"The greatest weapon against stress is our ability to choose one thought over another.\",author:\"William James\"},{text:\"How much more grievous are the consequences of anger than the causes of it.\",author:\"Marcus Aurelius\"},{text:\"No person has the power to have everything they want, but it is in their power not to want what they have not.\",author:\"Seneca\"},{text:\"Silence is a source of great strength.\",author:\"Lao Tzu\"},{text:\"To a mind that is still, the whole universe surrenders.\",author:\"Zhuangzi\"},{text:\"Muddy water is best cleared by leaving it alone.\",author:\"Alan Watts\"},{text:\"Smile, breathe, and go slowly.\",author:\"Thich Nhat Hanh\"},{text:\"Feelings come and go like clouds in a windy sky. Conscious breathing is my anchor.\",author:\"Thich Nhat Hanh\"},{text:\"Doing nothing is better than being busy doing nothing.\",author:\"Lao Tzu\"},{text:\"The quieter you become, the more you can hear.\",author:\"Ram Dass\"},{text:\"In the midst of movement and chaos, keep stillness inside of you.\",author:\"Deepak Chopra\"},{text:\"Peace comes from within. Do not seek it without.\",author:\"Buddha\"},{text:\"When you realize nothing is lacking, the whole world belongs to you.\",author:\"Lao Tzu\"},{text:\"In silence there is eloquence. Stop turning the wheel of thinking.\",author:\"Rumi\"},{text:\"The soul always knows what to do to heal itself. The challenge is to silence the mind.\",author:\"Caroline Myss\"},{text:\"Step out of the circle of time and into the circle of love and stillness.\",author:\"Rumi\"},{text:\"To be calm is the highest achievement of the self.\",author:\"Zen Wisdom\"},{text:\"Within you, there is a stillness and a sanctuary to which you can retreat at any time.\",author:\"Hermann Hesse\"},{text:\"Do not let the behavior of others destroy your inner peace.\",author:\"Dalai Lama\"},{text:\"The mind is like water. When it's turbulent, it's difficult to see. When it's calm, everything becomes clear.\",author:\"Prasad Mahes\"},{text:\"Tension is who you think you should be. Relaxation is who you are.\",author:\"Chinese Proverb\"},{text:\"Learn to be quiet enough to hear the genuine within yourself so that you can hear it in others.\",author:\"Marian Wright Edelman\"},{text:\"He who knows when he has enough is rich.\",author:\"Lao Tzu\"},{text:\"True intelligence requires a tranquil observer behind the thoughts.\",author:\"Jiddu Krishnamurti\"},{text:\"One of the best feelings in the world is knowing your presence and absence both mean something.\",author:\"Zen Maxim\"},{text:\"Look at a tree, a flower, a plant. Let your awareness rest upon it. How still they are, how deeply rooted in Being.\",author:\"Eckhart Tolle\"},{text:\"The primary cause of unhappiness is never the situation but your thoughts about it.\",author:\"Eckhart Tolle\"},{text:\"Inner peace begins the moment you choose not to allow another person or event to control your emotions.\",author:\"Pema Ch\xf6dr\xf6n\"},{text:\"You cannot see your reflection in boiling water. Similarly, you cannot see the truth in a state of anger.\",author:\"Ancient Proverb\"},{text:\"Be like water making its way through cracks. Adjust to the object, and you shall find a way around or through it.\",author:\"Bruce Lee\"},{text:\"Empty your mind, be formless, shapeless, like water.\",author:\"Bruce Lee\"},{text:\"Wherever you are, be there totally.\",author:\"Eckhart Tolle\"},{text:\"Your goal is not to battle with the mind, but to witness the mind.\",author:\"Swami Muktananda\"},{text:\"Stillness is where all creative insights and profound breakthroughs are born.\",author:\"Rick Rubin\"},{text:\"Clarity of mind requires space, not speed.\",author:\"James Clear\"},{text:\"Almost everything will work again if you unplug it for a few minutes, including you.\",author:\"Anne Lamott\"},{text:\"Slow down and everything you are chasing will come around and catch you.\",author:\"John De Paola\"},{text:\"Your mind will answer most questions if you learn to relax and wait for the answer.\",author:\"William S. Burroughs\"},{text:\"Calmness is the cradle of power.\",author:\"Josiah Gilbert Holland\"},{text:\"Simplicity is the ultimate sophistication.\",author:\"Leonardo da Vinci\"},{text:\"Don't underestimate the value of Doing Nothing, of just going along, listening to all the things you can't hear.\",author:\"A.A. Milne\"},{text:\"The ability to perform deep work is becoming increasingly rare at exactly the same time it is becoming increasingly valuable.\",author:\"Cal Newport\"},{text:\"Who you are, what you think, feel, and do, is the sum of what you focus on.\",author:\"Winifred Gallagher\"},{text:\"Busyness is a form of laziness \u2014 lazy thinking and indiscriminate action.\",author:\"Tim Ferriss\"},{text:\"Great minds discuss ideas; average minds discuss events; small minds discuss people.\",author:\"Eleanor Roosevelt\"},{text:\"The less you open your heart to others, the more your heart suffers.\",author:\"Deepak Chopra\"},{text:\"Nothing diminishes anxiety faster than action, and nothing deepens insight faster than stillness.\",author:\"Naval Ravikant\"},{text:\"Peace is the result of retraining your mind to process life as it is, rather than as you think it should be.\",author:\"Wayne Dyer\"},{text:\"There are two ways to get enough. One is to continue to accumulate more. The other is to desire less.\",author:\"G.K. Chesterton\"},{text:\"It is not daily increase, but daily decrease. Hack away at the unessential.\",author:\"Bruce Lee\"},{text:\"The greatest art is the art of letting go.\",author:\"Mingyur Rinpoche\"},{text:\"Deep breathing is our body's built-in reset button.\",author:\"Somatic Health Research\"},{text:\"Solitude is where I place my chaos to rest and awaken my inner stillness.\",author:\"Kac Young\"},{text:\"Silence is the sleep that nourishes wisdom.\",author:\"Francis Bacon\"},{text:\"When you focus on the present moment, fear and regret lose their power.\",author:\"Mindfulness Principle\"},{text:\"A quiet mind can hear the whisper of intuition over the shout of anxiety.\",author:\"Stillness Maxim\"},{text:\"Let your breath be your anchor whenever the waves of thought become turbulent.\",author:\"Zen Teacher\"},{text:\"Every profound realization began in a moment of quiet listening.\",author:\"Ethereal Wisdom\"},{text:\"Nothing is as calming as the realization that you do not need to react to everything you feel.\",author:\"Emotional Resilience\"},{text:\"Hold your center. The world will always swirl around you, but you decide what enters your sanctuary.\",author:\"Daily Stillness\"},{t